 icecream-brazelton,Workplaces & goods,Brazelton ice-cream rooms and family packs,100 E. Madison and 237 W. Madison,1871 directory compilation; entry date and continued occupancy on October 8 unverified.,listed,"W. P. Brazelton & Co. advertise ice cream at 15 cents a plate and family creams and ices packed in ice at 50 cents a quart, 90 cents a half gallon and $1.75 a gallon.",Brazelton ice-cream rooms and family packs,CREAM 15 CENTS PER PLATE. ... Packed in Ice ... $1.75 per gallon.,"Research counter service, portable ice-packed containers and cold-food delivery with two actual commercial addresses.","Historical address only. Resolve against the directory street guide and period maps before geocoding. The entry supplies no footprint, facade or room dimensions. Advertisement establishes an offer, not sales on October 8 or a verified delivery to any named hotel. Container form and opening hours are unknown.","[{""name"": ""plate price"", ""value"": 15, ""unit"": ""US cents"", ""qualifier"": ""advertised 1871 price""}, {""name"": ""quart pack"", ""value"": 50, ""unit"": ""US cents"", ""qualifier"": ""advertised 1871 price""}, {""name"": ""half-gallon pack"", ""value"": 90, ""unit"": ""US cents"", ""qualifier"": ""advertised 1871 price""}, {""name"": ""gallon pack"", ""value"": 175, ""unit"": ""US cents"", ""qualifier"": ""advertised 1871 price""}]",dir-1031,https://archive.org/details/edwardsannualdir141871chic/page/n1028/mode/1up,"Edwards’ Annual Directory of the City of Chicago, 1871, p. 1031",scan inspected
